ory_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"nePPSHdai8L7aWmXwOZHEg","review_id":"xybqMqKtpb32oQLo83rvDg","date":"2017-05-22T12:28:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9500485062599182,"text_excerpt":"Located inside the new Port Orleans Brewing on Tchoupitoulas, Stokehold is putting out great food. They do plates specifically meant to pair with certain beers, or you can order a la carte. Get the Patty Melt! It is on point, seriously so good. The Roast Beef Tartar is really well done, and for someone who would not consider herself a tartar enthusiast, this dish is delicious. Also, the Pretzel Rolls are perfect bites to enjoy with beers. The food these chefs are putting out is legit. If you haven't been yet, it's time! Note: The venue is dog/ kid friendly, perfect for large groups."},{"business_id":"nePPSHdai8L7aWmXwOZHEg","review_id":"JNdZ15MeQ0sYgaMtoiZwDg","date":"2017-10-09T04:14:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9415544271469116,"text_excerpt":"I have never ordered so much food in my life and enjoyed every single bite of all of it. Stokehold is essentially a single window inside of Port Orleans brewery serving high quality, unique dishes. The pumpkin salad was lovely-shaved pumpkin, apple, chèvre, pumpkin seeds, purple onions, in a light vinaigrette. The best fall salad I've ever had. I am nearly certain this is the only place in the city that serves raclette-a half wheel of a semi soft, mild cheese heated to its gooey point of melted goodness scraped onto anything, in this case, wagyu beef. Seriously. The special of the day was recommended enthusiastically by the gentleman that eventually would bring us on a quick but informati..."},{"business_id":"nePPSHdai8L7aWmXwOZHEg","review_id":"2XqAoKf4kt3z2DB0Nxrj6Q","date":"2018-08-20T20:36:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9250649213790894,"text_excerpt":"A completely unassuming spot inside of Port Orleans. If you're a beer drinker, the menu has beer pairing with all the items . Very delicious. Very unique. Just not what you would expect inside a brewery. Everytime I've been I've eaten new and delicious things. Occasionally they've had beer pairing dinners that are fantastic as well. I highly suggest a stop in even if you're not a beer fan."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"nePPSHdai8L7aWmXwOZHEg","photo_id":"uwlnUrsSawF-b-UOPZ7VJA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uwlnUrsSawF-b-UOPZ7VJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9195775985717773},{"business_id":"nePPSHdai8L7aWmXwOZHEg","photo_id":"iFYiD8bcucFTSeCc5IPQeQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/iFYiD8bcucFTSeCc5IPQeQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9109258055686951},{"business_id":"nePPSHdai8L7aWmXwOZHEg","photo_id":"8Hxm2wsL1jwq7clRuOQngA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/8Hxm2wsL1jwq7clRuOQngA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8994623422622681}]},"notebook_case":null}
